{"name": "Dark Cards of Candlewood", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The world is on the brink of endless night and you just lost all your best cards in a shipwreck.</strong> Rebuild your collection and save the town of Candlewood in this fantasy deckbuilder that combines the best parts of trading card games with a party-based RPG.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video aria-hidden=\"true\" autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"346\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3732830/extras/56e4d2ad90323eeeb1b2bd1f38814df3.poster.avif?t=1787912331\" width=\"616\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3732830/extras/56e4d2ad90323eeeb1b2bd1f38814df3.webm?t=1787912331\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3732830/extras/56e4d2ad90323eeeb1b2bd1f38814df3.mp4?t=1787912331\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Featuring a <u><strong>unique, two-choice card combat system</strong></u> that's easy to pick up yet surprisingly deep; weave together multiple hands using the chain system and discover a huge variety of keywords, status effects, and enchantments to build around!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><br/><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img alt=\"-Collect Cards Your Way-\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"150\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3732830/extras/8d912eb2e1ec7fa7983d0adb6f7bdb43.avif?t=1787912331\" width=\"1560\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collect hundreds of cards from six class-based sets! Spend your party's stat points to equip new cards and customize your decks to build the perfect team. Farm loot from adventures, borrow powerful cards from the library, prototype new keywords at the blacksmith, and spend your gold on packs at the shop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video aria-hidden=\"true\" autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"342\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3732830/extras/ca022bd1cbacf3b6607642f4fd99c877.poster.avif?t=1787912331\" width=\"612\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3732830/extras/ca022bd1cbacf3b6607642f4fd99c877.webm?t=1787912331\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3732830/extras/ca022bd1cbacf3b6607642f4fd99c877.mp4?t=1787912331\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><br/><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img alt=\"-The Soul of a JRPG-\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"150\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3732830/extras/d9364b1b390d85fe3dad59aecabdda61.avif?t=1787912331\" width=\"1560\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Retro aesthetic meets modern gameplay. Recruit new party members as you explore the world map and experience an epic JRPG adventure story  brimming with charm, humor, and melodrama.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video aria-hidden=\"true\" autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"344\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3732830/extras/7261dbe9dedc4e52b09642e1a129ea85.poster.avif?t=1787912331\" width=\"612\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3732830/extras/7261dbe9dedc4e52b09642e1a129ea85.webm?t=1787912331\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3732830/extras/7261dbe9dedc4e52b09642e1a129ea85.mp4?t=1787912331\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><br/><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img alt=\"-Replay and Upgrade-\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"150\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3732830/extras/149647ed5894898ab271d2f9c47e5d39.avif?t=1787912331\" width=\"1560\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Battle your way through randomized dungeons and defeat  bosses to progress the story. If you die, the only thing you'll lose is your loot! Help the villagers  upgrade the town of Candlewood to unlock even more powers and perks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video aria-hidden=\"true\" autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"346\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3732830/extras/ef170b80eb23e53ed5a4c15ac7b6652f.poster.avif?t=1787912331\" width=\"616\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3732830/extras/ef170b80eb23e53ed5a4c15ac7b6652f.webm?t=1787912331\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3732830/extras/ef170b80eb23e53ed5a4c15ac7b6652f.mp4?t=1787912331\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p> </div>", "short_desc": "A solo collectible card game with the soul of a classic JRPG. Embark on replayable dungeon runs with deceptively deep, two-choice card combat. Draft items for your backpack, master chain attacks, and even crack a few card packs...then save the world from eternal darkness!", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3732830/b28b9777ca84153be97f97ed6bbbff33b57c3a07/header.jpg?t=1787912331", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["JRPG", "Card Battler", "Roguelite", "Card Game", "Trading Card Game", "RPG"], "developers": "Lunoland", "publishers": "Lunoland", "release_date": "To be announced", "price": "Coming Soon", "appid": "3732830", "review_type": "Informational", "curator_desc": "23 February 2026 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/aHVkplpreMg", "first_seen": 1771801200.0, "review_rank": 1129}